WEBVTT

00:00:30.737 --> 00:00:34.793
The only problem was that I had written
that book about civility

00:00:34.817 --> 00:00:38.936
because I was convinced
that civility is ...

00:00:40.222 --> 00:00:41.380
bullshit.

00:00:41.404 --> 00:00:43.452
(Laughter)

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:46.525
Now, that may sound
like a highly uncivil thing to say,

00:00:46.549 --> 00:00:49.017
and lucky for you, and for my publisher,

00:00:49.041 --> 00:00:51.800
I did eventually come to change my mind.

00:00:51.824 --> 00:00:53.827
In the course of writing that book

00:00:53.851 --> 00:00:57.510
and studying the long history
of civility and religious tolerance

00:00:57.534 --> 00:00:59.264
in the 17th century,

00:00:59.288 --> 00:01:04.122
I came to discover
that there is a virtue of civility,